          },
          "mechanism": "Age at menarche reflects constitutional development and pubertal timing, which are associated with long-term hormone profile and developmental factors that can influence both menstrual cycle characteristics in adulthood and respiratory health outcomes.",
          "justification": "Age at menarche is a common cause of both the exposure (menstrual cycle characteristics) and the outcome (respiratory health and COPD risk).",
